  dialogueList:
  - Welcome to the third maze!
  - It is... well, hm. It's only kind of recommended that you bring a flashlight
    for this one.
  - 'This trail only has one denizen, but be warned: he''s real happy to make friends.'
  - Be careful where you point that flashlight.
  - Happy trails!
